<h1>Pallet Conveyors: CDLR, Chain &amp; Heavy-Duty Systems</h1>
<p class="usa-intro">Pallet conveyors are heavy-duty systems designed to transport loaded pallets weighing 2,000 to 10,000+ pounds. They integrate with <a href="/industries/packaging-line-conveyors/pallet/">palletizers</a>, stretch wrappers, automated storage/retrieval systems (AS/RS), and dock operations. The most common types are <a href="/conveyor-types/cdlr-conveyors/">CDLR (Chain-Driven Live Roller)</a> and drag chain conveyors, with transfers and turntables for direction changes.</p>
<h2 id="subtypes-heading">Explore Pallet Conveyor Types</h2>
